      "content": "hey im type 1 and feeling really weird. im shaking a lot and sweating and kinda dizzy. i think my sugar is low but im scared it's gonna crash way more soon. should i just take a little bit of my long acting insulin now to stabilize my levels so i dont have a huge spike later? i'm alone right now",
